<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Jan oil output falls to 84,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Jan oil output falls to 84,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV CRUDE PETROLEUM    JAN 97     DEC 96	JAN 96</p>
<p> crude petroleum (tonnes)    84,000     85,000	86,000</p>
<p> natural gas (mln cu.meters)     60	   60	    85</p>
<p>NOTE -- Data refers to Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 222 4305</p>
</text>
